<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kleinwort Benson said it upgraded Santa Isabel SA to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Santa Isabel has shaken off the poor operating costs performance of the second quarter and third-quarter earnings bear out our faith in management's quality,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 27-1/8 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
